{"schema_version":"question/v1","id":"q-system-ranking-metrics-001","type":"multi_choice","domain":"ml-system-design","topic":"evaluation","concept_id":"ranking-metrics","skill":"interview","prompt":"推荐/搜索排序系统评估时，哪些做法通常合理？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"同时关注离线排序指标和线上业务指标"},{"id":"b","text":"按位置、用户群和流量切片分析"},{"id":"c","text":"结合校准、延迟和覆盖率等系统约束"},{"id":"d","text":"只看一个整体平均 AUC 就足够"}],"correct_option_ids":["a","b","c"],"explanation":"指标要与目标、用户体验和系统约束对应，避免单一离线指标优化错方向。","wiki_refs":[],"status":"enabled","content_sha256":"sha256:daacf852c6a3a032866039e32cc4b5cbd9a4e4cd29906888b28b08ea7f5cc38e"}
